<title>USA: Sunbelt 5-month EPS $0.37 after charge.</title>
<headline>Sunbelt 5-month EPS $0.37 after charge.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunbelt Nursery Group Inc said Friday that for the five months ended June 30 its earnings were $3.1 million, or $0.37 per share, compared to $6.7 million or $0.79 per share in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The lawn and garden products retailer said current period figures include a $1.5 million charge for non-cancelable future lease payments and other related store closing costs.</p>
<p>The company said sales for the most recent period were $70 million up from $74.1 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said it changed its fiscal year to end on the Sunday nearest to June 30 so that the year would end with its natural business cycle.</p>
</text>
